ณ ONYX v2 BETA
ณ      3d engine by Michal Pomaranski
รฤฤฤฤฤฤฤฤฤฤฤฤฤ ฤฤฤฤฤฤฤ ฤฤฤ   ฤฤฤ  ฤ    ฤ
ณ Features:
ณ   - VESA 1.2 and newer compatible
ณ   - True Color (16777216 colors) modes supported
ณ   - 320x200 and 640x480 modes supported
ณ   - Z-bufferred, Gouraud shaded, textured, clipped triangles
ณ   - Polish doc's included
ณ   - easy to modify - pure C/C++ code without almost any asm
